## Changed

- Added Effect `Context.Service` / `Layer` boundaries for daemon configuration, provider, coordinator, and Unix server.
- Moved coordinator state to `SubscriptionRef`, command intake to a bounded `Queue`, and scoped worker/finalizer ownership into the coordinator layer.
- Added schema-tagged config, provider, command, and socket errors.
- Added a one-attempt system-media stream seam while retaining legacy `createSystemMedia()` retry compatibility.
- Kept the explicit-socket server adapter and current protocol/client behavior; server shutdown now tracks and destroys pre-hello sockets.
- Changed the daemon executable to build and run the Layer graph with scoped signal listeners.

Files touched: `packages/music-core/session/config.ts`, `provider.ts`, `coordinator.ts`, `server.ts`, `music-sessiond.ts`, `packages/music-core/system-media.ts`, `packages/music-core/tests/session-coordinator.test.ts`.

