## Residual risks

The implementation is a minimal vertical slice, not full coverage of every Phase 1 acceptance scenario. In particular, deterministic `TestClock` coverage and complete retry/poll/reconciliation behavioral coverage still need expansion before treating the migration as production-complete. The server callback uses its captured scope to launch connection effects; further hardening should replace this bridge with a fully consumed accept queue.
